📅 Phase 1: JavaScript Mastery (8 Weeks)
## Week 1: JavaScript Basics Review (Quick Refresh)

Variables (var, let, const), data types, operators
Conditions (if, else, switch)
Loops (for, while, for…of, for…in)
Functions (normal & arrow functions)

✅ Mini-projects:
1. Simple calculator
2. Temperature converter
