## Week 2: Arrays & Strings (ES6+ methods)

Arrays: push, pop, map, filter, reduce, forEach, find, sort
Strings: slice, substring, replace, split, template literals
Destructuring & spread/rest operator

✅ Mini-projects:
1. Word counter app
2. Student grade calculator
3. Grocery list manager (using arrays)
==============================================================================
## Week 3: Objects & DOM Basics

Objects, nested objects, this keyword
JSON basics
DOM: getElementById, querySelector, innerHTML, style changes, events (click, keyup, mouseover)

✅ Mini-projects:
1. Digital clock
2. Background color changer
3. Image slider
==============================================================================
## Week 4: DOM Advanced & Events

Event bubbling & delegation
Forms & validation
Creating/removing DOM elements
LocalStorage & SessionStorage

✅ Mini-projects:
1. To-do list (save to LocalStorage)
2. Form validation app (login/signup)
==============================================================================
## Week 5: Functions Deep Dive + OOP in JS

Higher-order functions
Closures & scope
Constructor functions
Classes, inheritance, super
this binding

✅ Mini-projects:
1. Bank account class (deposit/withdraw)
2. Library management (add/remove books)
==============================================================================
## Week 6: Async JavaScript (Very Important!)

Callbacks & Promises
async / await
Fetch API (GET/POST requests)
Error handling (try…catch)

✅ Mini-projects:
1. Fetch GitHub users API
2. Weather app using OpenWeather API
